# shiftOut of 0x55, most significant bit first, leaves the least significant
# bit in QA. led1 is QA. The other odd LEDs are on and the even ones are off.
open
step 50ms
expect @led1 lit
expect @led2 off
expect @led3 lit
expect @led4 off
expect @led5 lit
expect @led6 off
expect @led7 lit
expect @led8 off
expect no diagnostics
